      "status": "supported",
      "description": "Frontegg publishes a standard .well-known/openid-configuration discovery document per environment, found under Authentication → SSO → Identity Provider → OpenID Connect Endpoints.",
      "links": [
        "https://developers.frontegg.com/ciam/guides/management/frontegg-idp/via-oidc"
      ]
    },
    {
